Facebook-owned messaging app WhatsApp was today updated with expanded support for <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/carplay/">CarPlay</a>. &zwnj;CarPlay&zwnj; users are able to more easily call and message their friends and family members in WhatsApp directly from the car interface.<br/>
<br/>
